    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi bedo Kere ma Isiraili kodi Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo nonin je ma Isiraili jobino bongi Daudi i Hebron aka jowaco rigo ni, “Neni, wabedo ji acel aka remo acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cango munyo Saulo oyido fodi kere mawan, oyido itelo Joisiraili i lweny aka Rwoth ocikin nike ibino telo ji pere to ibedo jadhum pajo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno jotel ma Isiraili je jobino bongi Daudi i Hebron; aka kere Daudi otimo gi jo cikirok ruwaŋ Rwoth aka jowiro Daudi gi mo bedo kere ma Isiraili cungo kwoŋ wac ma Rwoth owaco ri Samwiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mako Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 15:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jothum 1:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi kodi Joisiraili je joŋanjo kadho i Yerusalem, meno Yebus, kama Joyebus oyido jonitie iye, ji ma lowo no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyebus jowaco ri Daudi ni, “Ikiladonjo ka.” To makada nende, Daudi omako kapondo Zayon, ma pama ilwoŋo ni tindi madwoŋ pa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi oyido owaco ni, “Ŋat'otel monjo Joyebus labedo jamituka jolweny!” Aka Yowab wod pa Zeruya am'otelo monjo to bedo jamituka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi okadho bedo i kapondo Zayon, aka ocaki lwoŋo nike tindi madwoŋ pa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ogeto tindi madwoŋ me thoko, cako i kam'oyido othor iye piny tundo yuthenge ma yuwok ceŋ matendere, aka Yowab oyiko thenge m'odoŋ je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi omedo lokirok matek, kole Rwoth Were pa lwak jolweny oyido nitie gi go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jolweny pa Daudi ma jotek",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a nyingi jolweny pa Daudi ma jotek. Kanyacel kodi Joisiraili, jokonyo go bedo kere, paka Rwoth oyido ociko; aka jokuro ker pere matek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marapena obedo Yasebim janono pa Hakmon m'otelo ji adek lweny gi cwo 300 aka joneko joje i lweny acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋata luwo go kwoŋ cwo adek ma jotek me oyido obedo Eliazar wod pa Dodo janono pa Aho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido nitie gi Daudi munyo Jofilistia jocokere kenyo lweny i Pas Damim, aka cwo ma Isiraili joringo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To go kodi Daudi jocungo i dier ndelo aka jolwenyo gi Jofilistia. Rwoth imiyo go loyo madwoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndelo acel, cwo adek kwoŋ cwo piero adek ma jotek joloro piny i ŋungu ma Abidulam, kama Daudi oyido nitie iye, kucel kitipa pa Jofilistia oyido joketho kambi i milelo Refayim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I waŋceŋ no Daudi oyido nitie kam'okanere, aka Jofilistia oyido jonitie i Bethelehem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi owinjo nike mito dok peco aka owaco ni, “Bedi nyatoro moro oyido nyalo miyan pi amadha wok i waŋ pi manitie i waŋkac ma Bethelehem!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo cwo adek ma joŋeyere jorire gi i kambi pa Jofilistia, jotwomo pi wok i waŋ pi ma waŋkac ma Bethelehem, aka jokelo ri Daudi. To Daudi k'onyalo madho; to konjo woko paka mic ri Rwoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka owaco ni, “Rwoth, akinyali madho pi me! Dinyo ocale p'amadho remo pa cwo me ma jojala kwo pajo!” Ameno go okwero madho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abisay omin Yowab, aka wod pa Zeruya am'oyido obedo jatel pa cwo piero adek ma jotek. Go olwenyo g'abor pere kodi cwo 300 to neko jo, aka oŋeyere swa kwoŋ cwo adek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 23:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido oŋeyere swa kwoŋ cwo piero adek, aka obedo jamituka pajo; to go oyido k'oŋeyere swa paka cwo adek ca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya wod pa Yehoyada ma wok Kabizel bende oyido obedo jacwo ma jamaker; otimo gigipiny madongo kweth, to neko kiri jolweny madongo ario ma Jomowab. Ndelo moro go odonjo i bur munyo pe cwe to neko simbwor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bende oneko jacwo m'ogaŋere ma Jamisir m'oyido nitie gi toŋ. Benaya omonjo go g'abiro, aka omayo Jamisir toŋ wok i cinge to neko go gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a tim ma miseni ma Benaya wod pa Yehoyada otimo, aka omiyo go nyinge kwoŋ cwo adek ca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oyido oŋeyere kwoŋ cwo piero adek, to oyido k'oŋeyere swa paka cwo adek ca. Aka Daudi oketho go paka jatel pa jokur pere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me a cwo pa Daudi ma jomaker; Asahel omin Yowab oyido obedo acel kwoŋ cwo piero adek; Elihanan wod pa Dodo ma wok Bethelehem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samoth ma wok i Harod, Helez ma wok i Pelet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira wod pa Ikes ma wok Tekowa, Abieza ma wok Anathoth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibekay ma wok Husa, Ilay ma wok Aho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharay ma wok Netofa, Heled wod pa Bana ma wok Netofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ithay wod pa Ribay ma wok Gibeya i Benyamin, Benaya ma wok Pirathon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huray ma wok milelo cegin gi Gas, Abiel ma wok Ariba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azimaveth ma wok Baharum, Eliaba ma wok Salibon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasem ma wok Gizon, Yonathan wod pa Sage ma wok Harar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiyam wod pa Sakar ma wok Harar, Elifal wod pa Ur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefer ma wok Mekera, Ahija ma wok Pelon, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heziro ma wok Kamel, Naray wod pa Ezibay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowel omin Nathan, Mibihar wod pa Hagar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zelek ma wok Amon, Nahor ma wok Beroth, aka jago pa Yowab wod pa Zeruya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira kodi Gareb ma jowok Jatir, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uriya Jahiti, Zabad wod pa Alay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adina wod pa Siza (jatel i nono pa Ruben, kodi kitipa pere won ma jolweny piero adek) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanan wod pa Maka, Yosafat ma wok Mithan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uziya ma wok Asitera, Sama kodi Yehiel wot Hotham ma wok Arower, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yediael wod pa Simiri, kodi omin Yoha ma jowok Tiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliel ma wok Mahava, Yeribay kodi Yosavia wot Elinam, Ithima ma wok Mowab, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliel, Obed, kodi Yasiel ma jowok Zoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
